OL,3,CMan walks 6 hours down mountain after
OL,4,Cimpaling himself with hiking pole
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,7,Fand images some people may find
OL,8,Fdistressing
OL,10,FA nurse who accidentally impaled
OL,11,Fhimself with his own hiking pole
OL,12,Fturned down a helicopter rescue `
OL,13,Finstead walking ten miles down the
OL,14,Fmountain.
OL,16,FDavid Cifaldi was with two friends as
OL,17,Fthey approached the ominously-named
OL,18,FFroze-to-Death Plateau, the highest
OL,19,Fpeak in the US state of Montana.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
