PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785482286
OL,3,CMan walks 6 hours down mountain after
OL,4,Cimpaling himself with hiking pole
OL,6,FHe said there was little pain or
OL,7,Fblood, and the pole wasn't moving.
OL,9,F"I was like, 'We've got to get off
OL,10,Fthis mountain.' And they're both like,
OL,11,F'I don't know about that,'" he said of
OL,12,Fhis friends' initial reaction. "I'm
OL,13,Fpretty confident this is outside my
OL,14,Fchest wall. 'Tis but a flesh wound."
OL,16,FThe group used a satellite-based
OL,17,Fcommunication device, a Garmin
OL,18,FinReach, to contact local authorities
OL,19,Fand inform them of their plan to head
OL,20,Fback down the mountain.
OL,26,@qD@AOUtD@`OUvD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
