SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785482286
OL,3,CMan walks 6 hours down mountain after
OL,4,Cimpaling himself with hiking pole
OL,6,FThey then started hiking ` carefully
OL,7,Fdescending from the plateau along an
OL,8,Funmarked route with the pole awkwardly
OL,9,Fsticking out of Mr Cifaldi's side.
OL,11,FThe trio navigated their way through
OL,12,Fboulders and snowfields before
OL,13,Fbushwhacking their way to an
OL,14,Festablished trail.
OL,16,FAfter more than six hours, in which
OL,17,Fthey travelled about 10 miles and
OL,18,Fdescended roughly 5,000 feet, the
OL,19,Fgroup reached a trailhead where one of
OL,20,Fthem, Mr Cifaldi's friend Jesse Ross,
OL,21,Fhad parked a vehicle.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
