PN,31605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785482286
OL,3,CMan walks 6 hours down mountain after
OL,4,Cimpaling himself with hiking pole
OL,6,F"The only reason it was possible at
OL,7,Fall was his confidence," Mr Ross said.
OL,8,F"Who are we to say anything? He's the
OL,9,Fmedical person. Our job is just to
OL,10,Fsupport at that point."
OL,12,FMr Cifaldi had long wanted to climb
OL,13,FGranite Peak, which is around 12,800
OL,14,Ffeet tall and is prone to
OL,15,Funpredictable weather including
OL,16,Fdangerous lightning storms and bitter
OL,17,Fcold.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@XO]pD@AOUrD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
