CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785482286
OL,3,CMan walks 6 hours down mountain after
OL,4,Cimpaling himself with hiking pole
OL,6,FStillwater County Search and Rescue
OL,7,Fteam commander Ty Williams monitored
OL,8,Fthe group's progress via a dispatcher
OL,9,Fwho took their calls.
OL,11,F"There was no danger to anybody else.
OL,12,FHe didn't want our help, and so we're
OL,13,Fnot going to essentially violate his
OL,14,Frights or go against his wishes by
OL,15,Fforcing our help on him," Mr Williams
OL,16,Fsaid.
