CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785482286
OL,3,CMan walks 6 hours down mountain after
OL,4,Cimpaling himself with hiking pole
OL,6,FMr Cifaldi impaled himself shortly
OL,7,Fbefore 9.45am that morning, and by
OL,8,F3.30pm the hikers were in a vehicle
OL,9,Fheading towards the nearest clinic.
OL,11,FWhen they arrived, they were told he
OL,12,Fneeded more advanced treatment, and
OL,13,Fheaded to the city of Billings.
OL,15,FDoctors at St Vincent Regional
OL,16,FHospital, where Mr Cifaldi happens to
OL,17,Fwork, removed the pole and bandaged
OL,18,Fhim up. He returned to work this week.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
