FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785482286
OL,3,CMan walks 6 hours down mountain after
OL,4,Cimpaling himself with hiking pole
OL,6,F"I think 99 times out of a hundred I
OL,7,Fwould make the same decision," Mr
OL,8,FCifaldi said. "Search and rescue
OL,9,Fcoming to help you is free. The
OL,10,Fflight's not. That was a factor in me
OL,11,Fdeciding to self-rescue.
OL,13,F"But the fact that I had two
OL,14,Fexperienced great friends with me and
OL,15,Fwe had the ability to contact search
OL,16,Fand rescue if something went wrong
OL,17,Fmade that a lot more of an easy
OL,18,Fdecision."
